INSERT INTO agent_messages VALUES(93,'test_tool_tracking','{"call_id": "call_ZHmkHG3TyFhCCtxCO6aUgcEq", "output": "The Ontario Drug Benefit (ODB) formulary covers several diabetes medications. Here are some of those that are covered:\n\n1. **Tresiba (Insulin Degludec)**:\n   - **DINs**:\n     - [02467887](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02467887) - 200U/mL (Inj Sol-Flextouch Pref Pen 3x3mL Pk)\n     - [02467860](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02467860) - 100U/mL (Inj Sol-3X5mL Cart Pk)\n     - [02467879](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02467879) - 100U/mL (Inj Sol-Flextouch Pref Pen 5x3mL Pk)\n   - **Coverage**: General Benefit\n\n### Not Covered:\nSome diabetes medications like **Diabeta (Glyburide)** are not covered under the ODB:\n- **DINs**:\n  - [02224569](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02224569) - 5mg Tab \n  - [02224550](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02224550) - 2.5mg Tab \n- **Coverage**: Not a Benefit\n\n### Next Steps:\nFor specific patients, consider their eligibility under certain criteria or explore alternative medications that might be covered. Always verify the most current coverage details through the official [Ontario Drug Benefit website](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary).", "type": "function_call_output"}','2025-09-28 23:28:20');
INSERT INTO agent_messages VALUES(94,'test_tool_tracking','{"id": "msg_68d9c49611d48197b028525516a6cb5b0ac78fc1c5de997d", "content": [{"annotations": [], "text": "### Summary\n\nIn Ontario, the Ontario Drug Benefit (ODB) formulary provides coverage for specific diabetes medications, offering financial support to eligible patients.\n\n### Covered Diabetes Medication\n\n- **Tresiba (Insulin Degludec)**\n  - **Forms and DINs**:\n    - 200U/mL (Flextouch Pref Pen) - [DIN 02467887](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02467887)\n    - 100U/mL (Cartridge) - [DIN 02467860](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02467860)\n    - 100U/mL (Flextouch Pref Pen) - [DIN 02467879](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02467879)\n  - **Coverage**: General Benefit\n\n### Medications Not Covered\n\n- **Diabeta (Glyburide)**\n  - **Forms and DINs**:\n    - 5mg Tablet - [DIN 02224569](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02224569)\n    - 2.5mg Tablet - [DIN 02224550](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary/results.xhtml?q=02224550)\n  - **Coverage**: Not a Benefit\n\n### Practical Next Steps\n\n- **Verification**: Always verify patient-specific coverage through the official [Ontario Drug Benefit website](https://www.formulary.health.gov.on.ca/formulary).\n- **Eligibility**: Consider alternative medications or additional resources for those not covered.\n- **Consultation**: For patient-specific recommendations, consult with healthcare providers.\n\n### Disclaimer\n\nThis information is for educational purposes only and should not replace professional medical advice. Always consult a healthcare professional for medical care and treatment decisions.", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message"}','2025-09-28 23:28:26');
